    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Miku?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Whaddya think yer’ doin’ sleeping in so late when we’ve got stuff to prepare for?",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": How did you get into my room?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Actually, better question. How did you get into my house?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mikumount2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/subscribestar/mikumount2.webp",
      "alt": "mikumount2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh. Ami let me in.",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": She’s doing her hair and stuff and they sent me in here to wake you up since I was the least likely to “do anything weird.”",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So your response is to mount me?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mikumount3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/subscribestar/mikumount3.webp",
      "alt": "mikumount3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That’s right! Because what they don’t know is that I’m not actually Miku at all!",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Then who are you exactly?...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": A succubus! Or a demon! Or a bat!",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Or something!",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mikumount4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/subscribestar/mikumount4.webp",
      "alt": "mikumount4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Actually, I just kinda kept adding random parts of costumes together until I got this.",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I haven’t grown much over the last couple of years, so this year I’m just all three costumes wrapped into one.",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh okay. I completely understand why you’re on top of me then.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Miku’s weight presses down against my crotch, which isn’t exactly the smartest move to make on a perverted male first thing in the morning.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Certain biological functions are bound to happen.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And considering the house is full of other girls and no one ever seems to lock doors in Kumon-mi, this could quickly turn into a problem.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mikumount1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/subscribestar/mikumount1.webp",
      "alt": "mikumount1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m on top of you because I tapped ya on the shoulder a bunch of times and you just wouldn’t wake up.",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But I can see you’re up now, Sensei.",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You mean ‘awake,’ right?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mikumount5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/subscribestar/mikumount5.webp",
      "alt": "mikumount5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hm? What else would I mean?",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You just said “up” with a certain inflection that made me think you might be talking about something else.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But what else would I be...",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mikumount6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/subscribestar/mikumount6.webp",
      "alt": "mikumount6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Uhhhhhhh...",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Finally catch on?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mikumount7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/subscribestar/mikumount7.webp",
      "alt": "mikumount7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I think so...",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Probably not a smart move to just...hop on ya first thing in the mornin’, huh?",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I mean, I don’t have a problem with it.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mikumount8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/subscribestar/mikumount8.webp",
      "alt": "mikumount8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": H-How did you even get like...that?!",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is it the wings?! It's the wings, isn't it?!",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": They definitely help, I won’t lie.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mikumount7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/subscribestar/mikumount7.webp",
      "alt": "mikumount7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, umm...uhh...",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What do we do now?...",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Miku freezes on top of me, being extra careful to not move at all.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Probably out of fear of not...stimulating me even more or something.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What do you mean, “What do we do now?” Isn’t this the part where you take responsibility or something?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I think that's standard procedure in situations like this.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mikumount8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/subscribestar/mikumount8.webp",
      "alt": "mikumount8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": N-No way! I’m not even responsible enough to finish my homework! Like heck I’m gonna take responsibility for whatever it is I’m sitting on!",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So you’re just going to...sit there until it goes away?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mikumount7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/subscribestar/mikumount7.webp",
      "alt": "mikumount7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": How long does that normally take?",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Anywhere from a few minutes to...longer than that?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I can wait a few minutes.",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s not like I’m uncomfortable or anything.",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I didn’t even realize anything weird was underneath me until you pointed it out.",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That’s kind of offensive, Miku.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Shh! If you keep drawin' attention to it I’ll start thinkin’ weird things and then before I know it we’ll have three kids and a puppy.",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Did you lock the door at least?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mikumount8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/subscribestar/mikumount8.webp",
      "alt": "mikumount8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": 'Course I didn’t lock the heckin’ door! I didn’t expect ya to get all Dwayne “The Rock” Johnson on me!",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What a strange way to describe an erection.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mikumount9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/subscribestar/mikumount9.webp",
      "alt": "mikumount9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ahhh! This is the exact opposite reason of why the girls chose me to come in here!",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Won’t they get suspicious if you stay in here any longer, then?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": They probably already are suspicious!",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": They probably think you’re teaching me how to do the cowboy!",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But if I just...get off of you then it’ll be all like “BAM” and smack me in the face and I’ll get knocked unconscious and stuff!",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": How did you go from not feeling anything to worrying about it smacking you in the face?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mikumount10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/subscribestar/mikumount10.webp",
      "alt": "mikumount10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": How’d you go from thinkin’ I look like a boy to turnin’ into a statue when I get on top of ya?",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I never said you look like a boy. That’s what you always say.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": In fact, I’m pretty sure I’ve told you I think you’re cute on several occasions now.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mikumount11",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/subscribestar/mikumount11.webp",
      "alt": "mikumount11"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You mean those weren’t jokes?",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why would they be jokes?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well...ya know. I’m always surrounded by girls like Karin and Kirin and they make me look even more...Miku-ish than I already am.",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I like Miku-ish girls, I guess.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mikumount12",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/subscribestar/mikumount12.webp",
      "alt": "mikumount12"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, um...th-thanks.",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’ll try to remember that if the others ever trust me enough to wake ya up again...",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ya know. So I don't...turn you into The Rock and stuff.",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is it back to normal yet?",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Not even close.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mikumount13",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/subscribestar/mikumount13.webp",
      "alt": "mikumount13"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Really?...",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Being a boy sounds hard. Like really hard.",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Like, super duper extra friggin’ hard.",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are we still talking about being a boy or have you moved on to talking about my penis?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t know. I’m feelin’ a lot of stuff I don’t normally feel right now.",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t even know if I could get up right now if I wanted to. My legs feel all stiff and stuff.",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I can relate to that.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah, I friggin’ know ya can relate to that.",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Several minutes have gone by with Miku just...sitting on my lap.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Her body is light and warm, but that’s really all I can say about it right now on account of her vehemently refusing to move.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mikumount14",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/subscribestar/mikumount14.webp",
      "alt": "mikumount14"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So, ya excited for the party tonight?",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are we just going to have a normal conversation now?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well it beats all the innuendos, doesn’t it?",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I know I don’t look like one, but a girl can only handle so much before her brain melts, ya know?",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And it’s not helpin’ that you’re half-naked and stuff.",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Someone could get the wrong idea really quick if they saw us like this.",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mikumount15",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/subscribestar/mikumount15.webp",
      "alt": "mikumount15"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yes, God forbid someone got the wrong idea after seeing this.",
